    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review Request (TEMPLATE)\nPlaceholders: REPLACE_TWILIO_CRED_ID, env TWILIO_FROM, CFG (business, Google review link, owner phone).\n\nFSM/job-complete -> POST /webhook/job-completed {phone, first_name, tech, job_id, flagged}. Twilio messaging -> /webhook/review-inbound-sms. Link-click redirect / review poller -> /webhook/review-event {phone, event}.\n\nNO REVIEW GATING: every customer gets the same public link; unhappy replies additionally alert the owner. No incentives. 180-day dedupe, 9AM-7PM AZ window, 2-message cap. State in workflow static data (use a DB/Sheet in production).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "30ddc1af-ca8c-4bae-99b2-5f969d208b12",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
